msgid "VMXNET3 网络驱动"
msgstr "VMXNET3 network driver"

msgid ""
"``drivers/net/vmxnet3/`` 为 PCI ``15ad:07b0`` 提供原生 VMXNET3 网卡 "
"驱动。``CONFIG_VMXNET3`` 为 tristate，默认内置；设置为 ``m`` 时生成 "
"``drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3.ko``，带有匹配该 PCI 设备的模块别名。 每个匹配的 PCI 功能独立分配 "
"DMA 环、控制状态并注册一个网络接口；它们 使用既有网络设备接口和 IPv4/IPv6 协议栈。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/net/vmxnet3/`` provides a native VMXNET3 network driver for PCI"
" ``15ad:07b0``. ``CONFIG_VMXNET3`` is tristate and built in by default; "
"setting it to ``m`` produces ``drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3.ko`` with a "
"module alias matching that PCI device. Each matching PCI function "
"allocates its own DMA rings and control state and registers one network "
"interface; the interfaces use the existing network-device API and "
"IPv4/IPv6 stack."

msgid ""
"共享配置和环采用设备约定的 DMA 地址及代际位，发送完成须对应最早 尚未回收的描述符；接收完成须指向本队列预期的缓冲区。异常索引或 "
"完成类型使该设备停止接收新的报文，避免复用不可信的 DMA 缓冲区。 QEMU 的 VMXNET3 模型将接收完成类型字段保留为零，驱动同时兼容 "
"该取值与设备协议的接收完成类型。驱动不接受分片报文，并在错误或 长度超出缓冲区时丢弃对应完成。"
msgstr ""
"Shared configuration and rings use the DMA addresses and generation bits "
"specified by the device. A transmit completion must correspond to the "
"earliest descriptor not yet reclaimed; a receive completion must point to"
" the expected buffer in its queue. An invalid index or completion type "
"stops that device from receiving new packets so untrusted DMA buffers are"
" not reused. QEMU’s VMXNET3 model leaves the receive-completion type "
"field zero, so the driver accepts that value as well as the protocol’s "
"receive-completion type. The driver does not accept fragmented packets "
"and discards completions with errors or lengths exceeding the buffer."

msgid ""
"协议字段根据 VMware Linux 驱动定义及 QEMU 的 VMXNET3 设备实现 核对：`Linux vmxnet3_defs.h "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3_defs.h>`_、"
" `QEMU vmxnet3.c "
"<https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/master/hw/net/vmxnet3.c>`_。 本目录的实现为 "
"ReliefNT 原创代码，遵循 Apache-2.0；不包含上述 GPL 源文件的实现代码。"
msgstr ""
"Protocol fields were checked against the VMware Linux driver definitions "
"and QEMU’s VMXNET3 device implementation: `Linux vmxnet3_defs.h "
"<https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/net/vmxnet3/vmxnet3_defs.h>`_"
" and `QEMU vmxnet3.c "
"<https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/master/hw/net/vmxnet3.c>`_. The "
"implementation in this directory is original ReliefNT code under "
"Apache-2.0 and does not contain implementation code from those GPL source"
" files."

msgid ""
"驱动选择 VMXNET3 revision 1 和 UPT 1，使用一条发送队列和一条接收 队列，不启用校验和、分段、VLAN 剥离、RSS 或 "
"LRO 等硬件卸载。接口 使用 1500 字节 MTU 和软件协议校验和。 目的地址过滤允许本站单播、广播和所有多播，以支持 IPv6 邻居发现。"
msgstr ""
"The driver selects VMXNET3 revision 1 and UPT 1 and uses one transmit "
"queue and one receive queue, without hardware offloads such as checksums,"
" segmentation, VLAN stripping, RSS, or LRO. The interface uses a "
"1500-byte MTU and software protocol checksums. Destination-address "
"filtering accepts local unicast, broadcast, and all multicast to support "
"IPv6 neighbor discovery."

msgid "中断与收发调度"
msgstr "Interrupts and packet scheduling"

msgid ""
"驱动查询设备的中断偏好，优先使用一个 MSI-X 表项，其次使用 MSI；设备 明确要求 MSI 时直接尝试 "
"MSI。不支持消息中断、分配失败或设备要求 INTx 时保留轮询回退，并保持设备中断屏蔽，不猜测共享 INTx 路由。消息中断 路由到 "
"BSP，发送、接收和控制事件共用一个向量。MSI 与 MSI-X 共用 16 个向量，每个向量在一次启动内不复用；耗尽时新设备回退到轮询。"
msgstr ""
"The driver queries the device interrupt preference, trying one MSI-X "
"entry first and then MSI; an explicit MSI preference skips MSI-X. If "
"message interrupts are unavailable, allocation fails, or the device "
"requests INTx, it retains a polling fallback with device interrupts "
"masked rather than guessing shared INTx routing. Messages target the BSP,"
" with transmit, receive, and control events sharing one vector. MSI and "
"MSI-X share 16 vectors, each used only once per boot; new devices fall "
"back to polling when this pool is exhausted."

msgid ""
"IRQ 回调仅屏蔽设备中断、刷新 posted write 并通知核心，不解析协议包。 核心以不复用的 ifindex "
"合并通知，不在排队期间保存模块回调或设备指针。 任务上下文每轮最多检查 32 个接收描述符，每张网卡连续最多检查 8 个， "
"满预算时重新排队；空队列才重新打开中断，并在打开后复查代际位，避免 丢失检查空队列期间到达的数据。原有协议维护心跳和同步轮询路径继续保留。"
msgstr ""
"The IRQ callback only masks the device interrupt, flushes the posted "
"write, and notifies the core; it does not parse packets. The core "
"coalesces notifications by never-reused ifindex, without storing module "
"callbacks or device pointers while queued. Task context checks at most 32"
" receive descriptors per turn and at most 8 consecutively per NIC, "
"requeuing when the budget is used. It rearms interrupts only after "
"observing an empty queue and rechecks generation bits after rearming to "
"avoid losing packets arriving during the empty check. Existing protocol "
"maintenance heartbeats and synchronous polling remain available."

msgid ""
"任务上下文消费并确认设备事件，包括 carrier 变化和队列错误。通知路径 不以旧 carrier "
"状态阻挡设备回调，否则链路恢复事件本身无法被处理。 行政关闭的接口仍排空和重新启用中断，但不把收到的数据投递到协议层。 中断模式使用事件更新的 "
"carrier 缓存，轮询模式继续查询设备；接收服务 也回收发送完成。补充接收描述符时，仅在设备设置 ``updateRxProd`` 时 写 "
"producer doorbell，减少每个包的 MMIO；初次投递仍显式通知设备。"
msgstr ""
"Task context consumes and acknowledges device events, including carrier "
"changes and queue faults. Notification processing does not gate callbacks"
" on stale carrier state, since a link-up event itself needs service. "
"Administratively down interfaces still drain and rearm interrupts but do "
"not deliver received packets to the protocol stack. Interrupt mode uses "
"an event-updated carrier cache; polling mode continues querying the "
"device. Receive service also reclaims transmit completions. Refilled "
"receive descriptors ring the producer doorbell only when the device sets "
"``updateRxProd``, reducing per-packet MMIO; initial posting still "
"explicitly notifies the device."

msgid "资源与错误处理"
msgstr "Resources and error handling"

msgid ""
"每次回调均保留实际设备 owner。设备停止时先关闭接入、屏蔽并排空 IRQ， 再同步 quiesce 和 reset，关闭 PCI bus "
"master 并回读； 未能证明停止时保留 DMA/MMIO 和模块所有权，以便管理器重试，而不 释放仍可能被访问的内存。设备命令是同步 MMIO"
" 操作，队列满时发送 返回 ``EAGAIN``，不会无限等待硬件进度。"
msgstr ""
"Every callback pins the actual device owner. Stopping a device first "
"closes callback admission, masks interrupts, and drains IRQ callbacks, "
"then synchronously quiesces and resets it before disabling PCI bus "
"mastering and reading it back. If stopping cannot be proven, DMA/MMIO "
"resources and module ownership are retained for a manager retry rather "
"than freeing memory that may still be accessed. Device commands use "
"synchronous MMIO; a full transmit queue returns ``EAGAIN`` instead of "
"waiting indefinitely for hardware progress."

msgid "验证"
msgstr "Validation"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_vmxnet3.py`` 编译真实驱动主体并模拟 PCI、MMIO 与 DMA "
"边界，覆盖版本协商、链路、收发环回绕、错误完成、资源回滚、失败 STOP 保留和多设备隔离，以及 MSI-X/MSI/轮询选择、中断重新打开竞态、"
" carrier 事件和 producer doorbell 条件。``tools/test_pci_msix.py`` 检查 MSI-X 表与 "
"PBA 的 BAR 边界、重叠、映射失败、表项屏蔽和旧向量隔离； ``tools/test_net_rx_budget.py`` "
"检查描述符预算与网卡之间的公平调度。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_vmxnet3.py`` compiles the real driver against modeled PCI, "
"MMIO, and DMA boundaries. It covers negotiation, carrier, ring "
"wraparound, malformed completions, resource rollback, failed-STOP "
"retention, device isolation, MSI-X/MSI/polling selection, interrupt rearm"
" races, carrier events, and producer doorbell conditions. "
"``tools/test_pci_msix.py`` checks MSI-X table/PBA BAR bounds, overlap, "
"mapping failures, entry masks, and retired-vector isolation; "
"``tools/test_net_rx_budget.py`` checks descriptor budgets and fairness "
"between NICs."

msgid ""
"ReliefOS 的 ``tools/test_vmxnet3_qemu.py`` 使用两张 VMXNET3 和一张 e1000e，验证 "
"DHCP、IPv4/IPv6、并发 TCP/UDP、真实 MSI-X 计数及模块 "
"卸载、重载。``tools/tests/vmxnet3_perf_guest.c`` 通过标准 socket 验证 全部 TCP 回显字节和 "
"UDP 数据，供父仓性能编排比较耗时、CPU 统计和 往返延迟。吞吐按单方向的回显有效载荷计算，不是双向加总或网卡线速。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefOS uses ``tools/test_vmxnet3_qemu.py`` with two VMXNET3 adapters "
"and one e1000e to check DHCP, IPv4/IPv6, concurrent TCP/UDP, actual MSI-X"
" counts, and module unload/reload. ``tools/tests/vmxnet3_perf_guest.c`` "
"uses standard sockets to verify every echoed TCP byte and UDP payload for"
" the parent repository benchmark, comparing elapsed time, CPU accounting,"
" and round-trip latency. Throughput counts echo payload in one direction,"
" not the sum of both directions or NIC line rate."

msgid ""
"QEMU 性能、VMware 基础联网、模块生命周期和长时间负载须分别记录， 不能互相代替。宿主模型和 QEMU 不能代替 VMware "
"实际环境验证； 物理硬件也未验证。此内部驱动与调度接口不扩展 Linux/POSIX 用户态 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"QEMU performance, basic VMware networking, module lifecycle, and "
"sustained-load validation must be recorded separately; none substitutes "
"for another. Host models and QEMU do not replace an actual VMware "
"environment, and physical hardware has not been validated. These internal"
" driver and scheduling interfaces do not extend the Linux/POSIX userspace"
" ABI."
